# Nautobot Change Copilot

Version: 1.0

Status: Greenfield Project

---

# Executive Summary

Nautobot Change Copilot is an AI-powered network change planning and automation platform.

It is a standalone Nautobot application.

It is NOT part of Workflow Launcher.

Workflow Launcher becomes one of several integrations used by Change Copilot.

The primary purpose of Change Copilot is to allow network engineers to describe intended changes in natural language and receive:

* Discovery results
* Impact analysis
* Risk assessment
* Change plans
* Automation recommendations
* Workflow execution options
* Configuration recommendations
* Validation procedures
* Rollback procedures
* Change request generation

The user describes intent.

The platform engineers the change.

