# Architectural Principles

## Principle 1

Intent First

The primary object is Change Intent.

Examples:

Decommission Site

Add Site

Upgrade Switches

Replace Firewall

Retire Circuit

Move Subnet

Deploy SD-WAN

Remove VLAN

Change planning begins with intent.

---

## Principle 2

AI Plans

Humans Approve

Systems Execute

The AI never directly changes infrastructure.

The AI:

Plans

Analyzes

Recommends

Explains

Execution occurs through approved systems.

---

## Principle 3

Nautobot Is The Source Of Truth

The AI must use Nautobot as the primary knowledge source.

Nautobot contains:

Sites

Devices

Interfaces

Prefixes

VLANs

VRFs

Circuits

Racks

Relationships

Custom Fields

Tags

The AI should treat Nautobot as a network knowledge graph.

---

## Principle 4

Workflow Launcher Is A Dependency

Workflow Launcher remains responsible for:

Workflow execution

AWX integration

Automation orchestration

Execution logging

Approvals

Workflow management

Change Copilot consumes Workflow Launcher APIs.

Change Copilot does not replace Workflow Launcher.

