Affected Assets

Risk Assessment

Dependencies

Recommendations

Impact analysis should be mandatory.

---

# Risk Engine

Purpose:

Calculate risk.

Factors:

Affected Users

Affected Devices

Affected Applications

Affected Circuits

Historical Failures

Workflow Confidence

Automation Coverage

